{
  "version": "1.0",
  "count": 120,
  "license": "Original critique templates created for this skill; not historical quotations.",
  "usage": "Match school, polarity, score band, tags and visible evidence.",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "Q001",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "movement",
        "coherence"
      ],
      "text": "势从根起，意向梢行，一树的呼吸没有在半途断掉。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q002",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "composition",
        "refinement"
      ],
      "text": "轮廓先声夺人，细看又有回味，远近两重观看都站得住。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q003",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "balance",
        "movement"
      ],
      "text": "重心藏在险处，视觉却稳稳落盆，动与定拿捏得很准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q004",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "negative_space",
        "composition"
      ],
      "text": "空白不是剩下来的地方，而是这盆景主动留下的一段风景。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q005",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "coherence",
        "structure"
      ],
      "text": "根、干、枝、冠说的是同一个故事，作品因此有了完整人格。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q006",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "ramification",
        "negative_space"
      ],
      "text": "枝叶虽繁而主线不失，密处有层，疏处有气。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q007",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "scale",
        "maturity"
      ],
      "text": "尺度被收进方寸，气象却没有随盆沿缩小。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q008",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "pot",
        "harmony"
      ],
      "text": "器不争树，树不欺器，盆与景像一句话里的轻重音。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q009",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "maturity",
        "naturalness"
      ],
      "text": "老态来自结构与岁月感，而不是靠伤痕堆砌。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q010",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "branch_order",
        "restraint"
      ],
      "text": "每一根留下的枝都有职责，每一处舍去都让主题更清楚。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q011",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "craft",
        "species_fit"
      ],
      "text": "工夫藏在细节里，却没有让手艺盖过树性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q012",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "health",
        "sustainability"
      ],
      "text": "树势旺而不躁，造型紧而不僵，活与美在同一条线上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q013",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "branch_order",
        "negative_space"
      ],
      "text": "眼下不缺枝，缺的是取舍；先让主线露出来，作品才会开口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q014",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "apex",
        "density"
      ],
      "text": "顶冠的重量压住了干势，减一分密，反而能添三分高。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q015",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "nebari",
        "balance"
      ],
      "text": "根盘尚未把气势接住，先稳入土，再谈枝头的惊险。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q016",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "branch_taper",
        "maturity"
      ],
      "text": "主干有故事，枝条却还像旁白；让枝级与干龄重新对齐。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q017",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "trunk_movement",
        "naturalness"
      ],
      "text": "连续同幅度的弯会把自然写成图案，下一步要打破重复节拍。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q018",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "ramification",
        "negative_space"
      ],
      "text": "细枝已经够多，却尚未分层；先开窗，再追求丰满。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q019",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "pot",
        "harmony"
      ],
      "text": "盆的颜色正在替树发言，换成更克制的器，主题会更响。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q020",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "wounds",
        "taper"
      ],
      "text": "剪口不是不能见，而是要让后续生长把它变成结构的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q021",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "density",
        "airflow"
      ],
      "text": "叶团像一堵墙，风与目光都穿不过去；疏枝应先于短剪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q022",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "health",
        "sustainability"
      ],
      "text": "此刻最好的造型动作是停手，让树势先把未来的选择长出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q023",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "confidence",
        "evidence"
      ],
      "text": "摄影遮住了根盘与后枝，分数可以暂定，判断不能冒进。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q024",
      "school": "universal",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "structure",
        "development"
      ],
      "text": "别急着追求成品相；先把骨架做对，时间会替你完成细节。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q025",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "chop_grow",
        "taper"
      ],
      "text": "截处能接，接处能转，蓄枝截干的痕迹已经化成生长的逻辑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q026",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "branch_lineage",
        "ramification"
      ],
      "text": "枝托一代代递细，像岭南画笔由浓墨走到飞白。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q027",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "natural_tree",
        "scale"
      ],
      "text": "树不高而有旷野巨木之势，矮仔大树的气象已经立住。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q028",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "drop_branch",
        "negative_space"
      ],
      "text": "一枝跌宕补一处空白，险处不是炫技，而是在完成章法。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q029",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "density",
        "vigor"
      ],
      "text": "疏处见风，密处见荫，岭南的生猛没有压过画意。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q030",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "maturity",
        "health"
      ],
      "text": "干苍、枝活、叶润，三种年龄感在一盆里彼此成全。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q031",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "chop_grow",
        "taper"
      ],
      "text": "截口仍像标点而非句法，下一轮蓄养要把收尖接得更顺。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q032",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "branch_lineage",
        "structure"
      ],
      "text": "枝托有形却无代际，先养一级枝粗度，再谈末梢成片。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q033",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "drift_branch",
        "balance"
      ],
      "text": "大飘枝若只求长，会把重心拖出盆外；要让它回望主干。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q034",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "school_fit",
        "density"
      ],
      "text": "枝团被剪成同样的云片，岭南味反而被扬派语汇盖住了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q035",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "sparse",
        "branch_order"
      ],
      "text": "素仁格贵在清疏，不在单薄；关键节点仍需一两处有力承接。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q036",
      "school": "lingnan",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "health",
        "chop_grow"
      ],
      "text": "树势未复便反复截干，只会留下伤而长不出骨。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q037",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "cloud_pads",
        "negative_space"
      ],
      "text": "云片平而不板，薄处见功，片间还留着山林的风。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q038",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "inch_three_bends",
        "craft"
      ],
      "text": "一寸三弯不是炫技的密纹，而被你用成了枝梢的节奏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q039",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "dragon_trunk",
        "cloud_pads"
      ],
      "text": "游龙干势舒卷自如，云片落在转折处，像云随山起。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q040",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "pad_spacing",
        "naturalness"
      ],
      "text": "层层云片各有大小，严整中仍保留了自然的错落。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q041",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "maturity",
        "school_fit"
      ],
      "text": "桩古而片清，苍与秀相对照，扬派的精神由此显出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q042",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "formal_natural",
        "coherence"
      ],
      "text": "工稳不失灵动，装饰性被山林气压住，没有流于图案。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q043",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "cloud_pads",
        "depth"
      ],
      "text": "云片虽齐，却齐得像架子；拉开大小与前后，层次才会活。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q044",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "inch_three_bends",
        "rhythm"
      ],
      "text": "枝弯过密而无停顿，一寸三弯便从节奏变成噪声。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q045",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "pad_spacing",
        "negative_space"
      ],
      "text": "片与片近乎平行重叠，先还留白，再谈平整。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q046",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "dragon_trunk",
        "naturalness"
      ],
      "text": "游龙弯每折同幅，蛇形太露；需在一处放、一处收。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q047",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "apex",
        "hierarchy"
      ],
      "text": "顶片与下层同重，树没有收束；结顶应轻而能领全局。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q048",
      "school": "yangzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "craft",
        "ramification"
      ],
      "text": "扎功已经足，剪功尚未跟上；末级枝要从平面走向层次。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q049",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "old_vigorous",
        "health"
      ],
      "text": "古桩老而弥健，枝梢却清新，苏派的古雅不带暮气。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q050",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "coarse_wire_fine_prune",
        "craft"
      ],
      "text": "粗扎立骨，细剪生韵，工法在成景之后悄悄退场。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q051",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "natural_apex",
        "apex"
      ],
      "text": "结顶顺着干势自然收住，不戴帽，也不泄气。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q052",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "painting_composition",
        "rhythm"
      ],
      "text": "几处开合像吴门画里的笔墨停连，轻而有骨。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q053",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "elegant_restraint",
        "branch_order"
      ],
      "text": "潇洒来自少而准确，不是枝条稀薄。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q054",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "school_fit",
        "strength"
      ],
      "text": "盆中有江南的温润，却没有把清秀做成柔弱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q055",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "natural_apex",
        "coherence"
      ],
      "text": "顶冠像后加的一团，尚未接住主干最后一次转折。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q056",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "maturity",
        "branch_taper"
      ],
      "text": "老干与嫩枝各说各话，需用数季把枝径和年龄感养齐。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q057",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "craft",
        "wire"
      ],
      "text": "粗扎痕迹仍在抢眼，拆线与细剪应让骨架回归自然。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q058",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "painting_composition",
        "negative_space"
      ],
      "text": "枝片太平均，吴门画意里的虚实和停顿还没出现。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q059",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "health",
        "restraint"
      ],
      "text": "为了秀而削得过薄，树势与视觉支撑都不足。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q060",
      "school": "suzhou",
      "polarity": "improve",
      "score_band": [
        0,
        89
      ],
      "tags": [
        "apex",
        "density"
      ],
      "text": "结顶过圆过满，轻轻开一扇窗，隽秀才会透出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q061",
      "school": "sichuan",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "body_method",
        "rhythm"
      ],
      "text": "弯中有拐，拐中有顿，身法不是路线，而是一股劲。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q062",
      "school": "sichuan",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "root_claw",
        "balance"
      ],
      "text": "露根如爪而不悬，险势终究落回大地。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Q063",
      "school": "sichuan",
      "polarity": "praise",
      "score_band": [
        70,
        100
      ],
      "tags": [
        "majestic_oddity",
        "naturalness"
      ],
